<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="300">
<title>osreport — Top Alarmas</title>
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
    --bg: #f2f3f7;
    --ink: #1c1e26;
    --ink-soft: #63667a;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --line: rgba(28,30,38,0.08);
    --accent: #3a5ad9;
    --accent-ink: #ffffff;
    --shadow-soft: 0 1px 2px rgba(28,30,38,0.04), 0 8px 24px -8px rgba(28,30,38,0.12);
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: "Segoe UI Variable", "Segoe UI", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, sans-serif;
    margin: 0; padding: 2.5rem clamp(1rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    color: var(--ink); background: var(--bg);
    /* faint radial mesh instead of a flat fill — reads calmer on a screen left open all day */
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%, rgba(58,90,217,0.06), transparent 45%),
                       radial-gradient(circle at 100% 10%, rgba(58,90,217,0.05), transparent 40%);
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); background: rgba(58,90,217,0.08);
    padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 1.65rem; font-weight: 650; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }

  .meta {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .meta span {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--ink-soft);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  }
  .meta span strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }

  .actions { display: flex; gap: 0.6rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .actions form { display: inline; }
  .actions button, .actions a.button {
    background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); border: none;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .actions button:hover, .actions a.button:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .actions button:active, .actions a.button:active { transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98); }

  .error {
    background: #fff1f1; border: 1px solid rgba(211,51,51,0.25); color: #9c2626;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; font-size: 0.88rem;
  }
  .powerbi {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    padding: 0.9rem 1.15rem; border-radius: 14px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .powerbi strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .powerbi code {
    background: var(--bg); padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem; border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); user-select: all; color: var(--ink);
  }

  .table-card {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); overflow: hidden;
  }
  .table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; min-width: 760px; }
  th {
    background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink-soft); text-align: left; padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); position: sticky; top: 0;
  }
  td { padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 0.85rem; vertical-align: top; }
  tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  tbody tr { transition: background 0.1s ease; }
  tbody tr:hover { background: rgba(58,90,217,0.035); }

  /* Severidad fills (severityColor) are pale Excel cell-background tones —
     readable as a fill, not as text. Pick a solid, accessible ink per
     label instead of reusing the fill color as the text color. */
  .sev-pill {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.78rem; padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .sev-pill::before {
    content: ""; width: 0.5rem; height: 0.5rem; border-radius: 50%;
    background: currentColor; opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .sev-pill[data-sev="Critico"] { background: #FFC7CE; color: #8a1f2d; }
  .sev-pill[data-sev="Alto"]    { background: #FFD9A0; color: #7a4a06; }
  .sev-pill[data-sev="Medio"]   { background: #FFEB9C; color: #6b5900; }
  .sev-pill[data-sev="Bajo"]    { background: #D9D9D9; color: #44464f; }

  .empty {
    color: var(--ink-soft); font-style: normal; background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center; box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<span class="eyebrow">Panel de alarmas</span>
<h1>osreport — Top Alarmas</h1>

{{if .LastError}}
<div class="error">Ultimo refresh fallo: {{.LastError}}</div>
{{end}}

{{if not .HasData}}
<p class="empty">Todavia no hay un reporte generado — espera al primer refresh o presiona "Actualizar ahora".</p>
{{else}}
<div class="meta">
  <span><strong>Generado:</strong> {{.Data.GeneratedAt.Format "2006-01-02 15:04:05"}}</span>
  <span><strong>Desde:</strong> {{.Data.From.Format "2006-01-02 15:04:05"}}</span>
  <span><strong>Hasta:</strong> {{.Data.To.Format "2006-01-02 15:04:05"}}</span>
  <span><strong>Total eventos:</strong> {{.Data.TotalEvents}}</span>
  <span><strong>Documentos omitidos:</strong> {{.Data.SkippedDocs}}</span>
  <span><strong>Ultima actualizacion:</strong> {{.LastUpdated}}</span>
</div>
{{end}}

<div class="actions">
  <form method="post" action="/api/refresh"><button type="submit">Actualizar ahora</button></form>
  <a class="button" href="/export.xlsx">Exportar Excel</a>
</div>

<div class="powerbi">
  <strong>Conectar PowerBI directo (sin descargar a mano):</strong>
  Obtener datos &rarr; Consulta en blanco &rarr; Editor avanzado, pega:
  <code>= Excel.Workbook(Web.Contents("{{.ExportURL}}"), true)</code>
  — cada vez que aprietes "Actualizar" en PowerBI, trae los datos mas recientes del dashboard.
</div>

{{if .HasData}}
  {{if .Data.TopAlarms}}
  <div class="table-card">
  <div class="table-scroll">
  <table>
    <tr>
      <th>Rank</th><th>Severidad</th><th>Componente</th><th>Alarma</th>
      <th>Descripcion</th><th>Ejemplo</th><th>Count</th><th>Anterior</th><th>Tendencia</th>
    </tr>
    {{range .Data.TopAlarms}}
    <tr>
      <td>{{.Rank}}</td>
      <td><span class="sev-pill" data-sev="{{severityLabel .Severity}}">{{severityLabel .Severity}}</span></td>
      <td>{{.Component}}</td>
      <td>{{.Alarma}}</td>
      <td>{{.Descripcion}}</td>
      <td>{{.Ejemplo}}</td>
      <td>{{.Count}}</td>
      <td>{{if .FoundInPrevious}}{{.PrevCount}}{{end}}</td>
      <td>{{trendLabel . $.Data.HasPreviousReport}}</td>
    </tr>
    {{end}}
  </table>
  </div>
  </div>
  {{else}}
  <p class="empty">Sin alarmas en este periodo — 0 eventos coincidieron con el filtro/rango configurado.</p>
  {{end}}
{{end}}

</div>
</body>
</html>
